<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="OBA" style="id">Obadiah</book>
  <para style="h">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Obadiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Obadiah mengmuhna Toupa Pathian in Edom tungtang ah hichi in a chi: Toupa a kipan thu ka thei a, namte lak ah palai sawl ahi, Thou unla, kidouna ah amah dou ding in i kuan ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ngai dih, namte lak ah k’on hihneuta hi; nakpi a muhsit in na omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw nang, suangpi kitam kal a teng, mun sang luah, kuan ahia lei a hon kesak ding lungsim a chipa? Na lungtang kisaktheihna in nang a hon khemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Muvanlai bang in sangpi ah lengtou mahle chin, na bu leng aksi lak a seh in om mah leh, huai a kipan k’on kaikhe suk ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Na kiang ah gutate, suamhatte zan in hongpai le uh, hihman nak hih na ni chia, a deihzah un a gukei ding ua hia? Na kiang ah grep lakhawmmite hongpai le uh, grep lak ding khenkhatte a nuse kei ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Esau thilte zonkhiak ahita a; A goubawm selgukte maikhiak ahita hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang lawmte khem in na om a, gamgi pha in hon delhkhe ding ua: na kituahpihte’n nang a hon zouta ua; na tanghou nete’n na nuai ah thang a kam ua; amah ah theihsiamna a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Huai ni chiang in Edom a kipan mipilte ka hihmang in, Esau tang a kipan theihsiamna ka hihmang kei dia hia? Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Teman, Esau tang ah michih thahgam a a omvekna ding ua, na mihatte nakpitak in a lunglel ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na unaupa Jakob tung a na hiamgamna ziak in zumna in nang a honkhuh ding, tangtawn a hihmanthat in na om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Langkhat a na din ni a, mikhualte’n a sum a lakmang ni ua, namdang mite a kulh kongkhak a a honglut ua, Jerusalem tung a ai a san lai un, nang leng amau lak a tel bang in na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh na unaupa a siatlai in awibawl kenla, Judah tate a manthat ni un kipak ken; a haksat ni’n kisatheitak in pau ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite a vangsiat ni un a kullh kongpi uah lut kenla; a vangsiat ni un a thuakna uh en kenla, a vangsiat ni un a sum leh paite uh tung ah na khutte uh nga sam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A mi khenkhat taikhete that ding in lamthuam ah ding in haksat ni’n a mi omsunte mansak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nam tengteng tung ah Toupa ni lah a nai ngal a: na hihsiat mah bang in na tung ah hih ahi ding; na hihdan nangmah luzang ah hongkik ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka tang siangthou a na dawn bang un, nam tengteng in a dawn gige ding ua, ahi, a dawn ding ua, a valh ding ua, pianglou bang in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Zion tang ah bel taikhete a om ding ua, a siangthou ding uhi; Jakob inkawte’n a goutante uh a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakob inkawte mei ahi ding ua, Joseph inkawte meikuang ahi ding, Esau inkawte buhpawl ding ahi ding ua, amau lak ah a kuang ding uh, a kang mang ding uh: Esau inkawte a val a omkei ding uh; Toupa’n lah a chita ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Simlam mite’n Esau mual a tang ding a; phaizang mite’n Philistia a tang ding uh: amaute’n Ephraim leh Samaria lou a tang ding uh: Benjamin in Gilead gam a tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kanaan mite lak a hiai Israel suan saltang mipite’n Zarephath gam tan a tang ding ua: Sephrad gam a Jerusalem khomite saltang in Simlam khopite a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zion tang apan Esau dou ding in a kuantou ding ua, a tung ah vai a hawm ding uhi; huan gam Toupa a ahi ding hi.”
  </para>
</usx>
